          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "yam28iz",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "5. AC Waveform"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "ca4vmzt",
      "content": "In AC circuits, voltage and current vary with time in a sinusoidal pattern. This waveform is called a sine wave. The waveform alternates between positive and negative values."
    },
